    "text": "<p>The potential energy curve for the formation of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> molecule as a function of internuclear distance of the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></math> atoms. The minima in the curve corresponds to the most stable state of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>.</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0182_9140b5095d71.png\" style=\"width: 388px; height: 237px;\" /></p>"
